{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月24日，參與使用Claude研究黎曼猜想的數學家levent在社交平台X發文，回應此前公開的證明材料及相關爭議。<strong>他承認自己在對外表達和代碼整理方面「做了一些蠢事」，但強調此次回應並不意味着證明存在錯誤，也沒有撤回此前的結論。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587818.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:04:08.395362+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:54:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_hash":"122d403e6689b0833035bf2f3f99ef86a0844d0bca3c8d21d9a8762e519bf1c1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}